          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa yisukulu ya Hebuloni, Hashabiya pamo ni acalongo acimjakwe 1,700, ŵandu ŵalunda, ŵalolelaga Aisalaeli ŵaŵaliji kungapilo lyuŵa kwa Lusulo lwa Yolodani pa masengo gosope ga mapopelo ni ga boma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeliya ŵaliji mlongola jwa Ahebuloni. Mcaka ca 40 ca ucimwene ŵa Daudi patendekwe kuwungunya nipo pasimanikwe kuti asilikali ŵane ŵakupikanika ŵa mwiŵasa lya Yeliya ŵatamaga ku Yasa ku Giliyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Daudi ŵasagwile acimlongola ŵakwanila 2,700 ŵa mwiŵasa lya Yeliya kuti ŵaloleleje Alubeni, Agadi nipo soni hafu ja lukosyo lwa Manase, pa yindu yosope yakwayana ni mapopelo nambo soni ya boma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
